## Output Report Format

After completing an operation, produce a structured report:

```markdown
## Asana Report

### Operation performed
- [create / update / sync / plan]

### Project
- Workspace: [name]
- Project: [name]

### Tasks affected
| Task | ID | Section | Status | Action |
|--------|----|-------|--------|------|
| Fix email validation | 12345 | In Review | Updated | Moved from "In Progress" to "In Review" |
| Implement offline cache | 12346 | To Do | Created | New task with 3 subtasks |

### Comments added
| Task | Summary |
|--------|-------------------|
| #12345 | PR #42 created, files: auth.py, auth.test.py |

### Dependencies configured
| Task | Depends on |
|--------|------------|
| #12347 | #12346 |

### Pending items
- [list of items needing attention or manual action]

### Next steps
- [recommended actions, if any]
```

